| Factory stages, candidate product CCs, versioned resources and independent admission | [[Designs/Capability Capsule Factory Feature]], [[Designs/Paper2Agent Capability Factory]] | Proposed feature split; M1 factory not built |

## Known weak spots

- Slide 9 is the main place a sceptical audience may push. It is framed as risks read from the design, not findings.
- Reported benchmark results have not been independently reproduced in AI4Research.
- No threshold, cost or model comparison is given for the pilot, which is in backup only.
